  "description": "LORYAV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H82 N6 O24 Tm4,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tm1 (Tm) has 8 O neighbors; Tm2 (Tm) has 7 O neighbors; Tm1B (Tm) has 8 O neighbors; Tm2B (Tm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.882-3.950 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.03-112.02°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H90N6O26Tm4.",
